msgid "Python built-ins reference"
msgstr "Referensi bawaan Python"

msgid "Python comes with a number of built-in functions and classes."
msgstr "Python dilengkapi sejumlah fungsi dan kelas bawaan."

msgid ""
"The built-in classes include data types that would normally be considered "
"part of the \"core\" of a language, such as numbers and lists.  For these "
"types, the Python language core defines the form of literals and places some "
"constraints on their semantics, but does not fully define the semantics."
msgstr ""
"Kelas-kelas bawaan mencakup tipe data yang biasanya dianggap sebagai bagian "
"dari \"inti\" sebuah bahasa, seperti angka dan list. Untuk tipe-tipe ini, "
"inti bahasa Python mendefinisikan bentuk literal dan menetapkan beberapa "
"batasan pada semantiknya, tetapi tidak sepenuhnya mendefinisikan semantik "
"tersebut."

msgid ""
"The built-ins also include functions and exceptions --- objects that can be "
"used by all Python code without the need of an :keyword:`import` statement. "
"Some of these are defined by the core language, but many are not essential "
"for the core semantics and are only described here."
msgstr ""
"Yang bawaan juga mencakup fungsi dan eksepsi --- objek-objek yang dapat "
"digunakan oleh semua kode Python tanpa perlu pernyataan :keyword:`import`. "
"Beberapa di antaranya didefinisikan oleh inti bahasa, tetapi banyak yang "
"tidak esensial bagi semantik inti dan hanya dijelaskan di sini."

msgid ""
"In addition to the built-ins, Python provides an extensive importable "
"standard library, see :ref:`library-index`."
msgstr ""
"Selain yang bawaan, Python menyediakan pustaka standar yang luas dan dapat "
"diimpor, lihat :ref:`library-index`."
